PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'heritage_restoration');
!}

= Wawel or the Royal Castle

Works in existing buildings, within the existing competences and the budget. Limited conservation is a small reform (1 T, 1 B for 2 months); a wider restoration with public access is a large one (2 B for 4 months). One project for each building; a completed one is not started again.

